WEBVTT

00:05:28.492 --> 00:05:31.511
ni ufunguo wa furaha.

00:05:31.511 --> 00:05:34.776
Tunayo funguo kuu ya furaha yetu

00:05:34.776 --> 00:05:36.579
katika mikono yetu.

00:05:36.579 --> 00:05:38.521
wakati kwa wakati,

00:05:38.521 --> 00:05:41.593
tunaweza kuwa na shukrani kwa zawadi hii.

00:05:41.593 --> 00:05:44.116
Ina maana kwamba

00:05:44.116 --> 00:05:47.629
tuwe na shukrani kwa kila kitu?

00:05:47.629 --> 00:05:49.532
Si hivyo.

00:05:49.532 --> 00:05:54.537
Hatuwezi kuwa na shukrani kwa vurugu,vita,

00:05:54.537 --> 00:05:57.360
kugandamizwa,kunyonywa na kuonewa.

00:05:57.360 --> 00:06:00.001
Katika hali ya utu,hatuwezi kuwa na shukrani